  43 # tick (`wish()`), the body moves by velocity, the figure turns toward where he goes (eased), the camera follows the
  44 # mouse only. A sidestep with the camera's facing would show the rig's forward cycle sliding sideways: the biped rig
  45 # reads speed, not direction, so he turns to his travel and the camera keeps the view.
