docs/reports\P14-SEAM.md:16:The brief's premise was wrong on this tree. After P13 the stand-in is no longer built in the frame. The view's share of a slow arrival frame was 5 to 20 ms; the game's own setup was 18 to 96 ms in a window, against 2 to 30 ms in P12's headless probe. Running Godot with `--render-thread separate` changed nothing, so it is not the mesh uploads alone.
docs/reports\P14-SEAM.md:41:**2. View's arrival work off the frame.**
