 337 func _canopy() -> void:
 338 	# round 2 (T-PATCHES M2): he runs along x past a row of trees just off his line; the chase camera behind him. A
 339 	# tick is "blocked" when the line from the point looked at to the camera passes through a crown (layer 4), "inside"
 340 	# when the camera itself is in one. Without the crowns in the camera's mask (round 1) and with them.
